# the base file with these changes: each hunk follows the lines it quotes
@@ after
 doubleagent {VERSION} starting on {HOST} ({SYSTEM}) mode=image root={WORK}/root uid={UID}
-hash=crypto/sha256 max_file_size=1MB full=0 no_secrets=0 no_docker=0 env_scan_home=0 env_scan_max_size=1MB no_preserve_atime=0
-NOTE: output directory {OUT} ignores letter case or Unicode form in names; a file or link whose name it takes for another file's, link's or directory's is not staged and its row says why (an output directory on a file system that compares names byte for byte keeps both)
+hash=crypto/sha256 max_file_size=1MB full=0 no_secrets=0 no_docker=0 env_scan_home=1 env_scan_max_size=1MB no_preserve_atime=0
+NOTE: output directory {WORK}/root/Users/bob/out [1] ignores letter case or Unicode form in names; a file or link whose name it takes for another file's, link's or directory's is not staged and its row says why (an output directory on a file system that compares names byte for byte keeps both)
@@ after
 relocation hint: {WORK}/root/srv/proj/mise/config.toml:2 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+Relocation hints for alice ({WORK}/root/home/alice)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/backup/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.example.swept.plist names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli) = {WORK}/root/opt/sw
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/backup/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.example.swept.plist:9 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/scripts/agent-env/deep/helper.ps1:1 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/scripts/agent-env/deep/helper.sh:2 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/scripts/steer/d\x0ax:1 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+sweep skipped: home {WORK}/root/usr/share/ollama lies outside the user home roots
+Relocation hints for nested ({WORK}/root/home/alice/nested)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/home/alice/nested/deep/helper.sh:1 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
+sweep skipped: home {WORK}/root/opt/frank lies outside the user home roots
+Relocation hints for bob ({WORK}/root/Users/bob)
+relocation hint: {WORK}/root/Users/bob/dotfiles/direnv/direnvrc:1 names CODEX_HOME (codex-cli)
@@ after
 Archiving
-done: {OUT}/{NAME}.tar.gz ({SIZE} bytes, sha256 {SHA256})
+done: {WORK}/root/Users/bob/out [1]/{NAME}.tar.gz ({SIZE} bytes, sha256 {SHA256})
